# Butler Routes - Darnassus recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns sold by vendors spawning inside Darnassus (zone
# 1457), verified against the local Forever game data. 30 recipes across 32
# vendor links (see docs/city-recipes-inventory.md). Each step is gated to
# its profession; the one pattern that names no profession anywhere in the
# data ships ungated with an honest note. No stock-class flag exists in the
# data, so nothing is marked limited.
guide butler-routes-completionist/darnassus-recipes
title Darnassus - Recipes & Patterns
levels 4-60
zone Darnassus
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords darnassus, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

